WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions from the recorded narration placements. Word-level timing and listening acceptance remain unverified.

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
[Piano. Studio opening, historical printing and Jai’s portrait.]

00:07.300 --> 00:12.214
Our idea was a call from your future self,
helping you

00:12.214 --> 00:17.128
keep going. That's what I love about
teaching and building: imagination

00:17.128 --> 00:18.915
becoming useful to someone.

00:21.500 --> 00:25.853
The prize gave me tools to keep building.
America can build

00:25.853 --> 00:30.207
extraordinary AI and still fail to build a
future its people

00:30.207 --> 00:31.790
have a stake in.

00:35.000 --> 00:39.928
I'm building Dharmic Data. A school where
people get paid to

00:39.928 --> 00:44.857
learn by building for their communities.
Time to learn. Teachers beside

00:44.857 --> 00:45.305
you.

00:52.250 --> 00:56.702
My bet is that a generation can become
builders, owners and

00:56.702 --> 00:58.725
stewards of our AI future.
